<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκαίνω</span></b> , late aor. 1
		inf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκᾶναι</span> (v. infr.): pf.
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λελεύκασμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.Siph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.54b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				102
			</span></i>:—<i>make white</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεύκαινον ὕδωρ ξεστῇς ἐλάτῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.172
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλα ῥοθίοισι λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς γένυν ἕρπει λευκαίνων ὁ χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.70
				</span></i>
			; <i>plaster with whitening</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκᾶναι τὰ λευκώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ephes.</u>
					3p.148
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be</i> or <i>become white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				730a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sopat.
				8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.545
			</span></i>, Diph.Siph.l.c.; <i>to be clarified</i>, of oil, Orib.l.c.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause to appear white</i>, of the effect of dawn on lamplight,
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				157
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>have a sensation of whiteness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.191
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>grow white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hyps.Fr.</u>
				34(60)
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				 i13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				890a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				13.19
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφροῖο</span>
			<i>with</i> foam, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				170
			</span></i>.</div>
